diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 725cadc..2faa826 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -399,0 +400,7 @@ old controller has exited.
+The adapter prepares its final-response file with owner-only permissions before
+launching Codex, so an orphaned child cannot leave that output dependent on the
+supervisor's final permission cleanup. An empty prepared file is not a completed
+response. Existing interrupted-agent recovery nevertheless treats its presence
+conservatively and stops for explicit adoption rather than automatically retrying
+the call, including when interruption occurs before any response is written.
+
